// B2 course (B1 → B2 roadmap), module 5 „Arvamus ja põhjendamine” (b1b2-021…025), stage B2-.
// Lesson template v4 (docs/COURSE_DESIGN_COMMUNICATIVE.md §12). One storyline, a year after the B1 course: Sofia passed
// B1 and is a project manager at Tuul Logistika — she has to defend proposals in Estonian, so she joins the evening
// debate club „Arutelukohvik” in the Kase kool hall. One goal said on the first sheet: at the end the learner takes part
// in the public debate on a new tram line in Kalamaja (Harno B2 speaking: pro / contra cards → a decision) and writes
// an opinion piece of about 180 words for the local paper „Kalamaja Leht” (024 Kasuta).
// Grammar (B2, docs/METHODOLOGY_STANDARD.md §5): degrees of certainty and hedging — kindlasti, ilmselt,
// tõenäoliselt, võib-olla / võib olla, vaevalt, ma kahtlen, kas…, peaks / ei saa olla (021, back in 024); argument
// connectors with the verb second — esiteks, pealegi, näiteks, seega, järelikult, kokkuvõttes (022, used in 024);
// concessive kuigi / siiski / ometi (not „kuigi … aga”) and the conditional that softens — ma pakuksin, kas poleks
// mõistlikum, kas me võiksime (023, back in 024 and in the 022 cloze); comparison — võrreldes -ga, erinevalt -st,
// seevastu, mida … seda (024). Module 4's words return: kohustuslik, keelatud, luba, lubama, nõudma, vastutama, kord,
// reegel, tohtima, and its verb government (sõltuma millest, loobuma millest, nõustuma kellega — 022 formtext).
//   021 Kase kool asks about a school uniform: the school paper's article with four voices, the debate club's first
//       evening (listening), two schools' experience (sentence bank); the board's survey — talk with the board's
//       chair, a speech in the hall and a letter to the board.
//   022 Anna and Viktor at the bus stop: free public transport (listening, the argument bridge of the picture);
//       Viktor's letter to the paper (4-option cloze), Anna's speech (forms in a text); the radio news on the
//       Kalamaja tram — Sofia and her neighbour Tiina on the stairs, a voice message and a post for the community page.
//   023 Tuul Logistika and a four-day week: the intranet thread; a Harno B2 article with 10 MC questions, Sofia's
//       summary (forms), „kuigi … aga” fixed; the team meeting with pro / contra cards, a decision and a mail to Liis.
//   024 The city planner compares a tram and a bus lane (Harno lecture gap fill); other cities' experience (sentence
//       bank), Ruslan's and Tiina's letters, two carriers at work; the public debate in the Kalamaja library — opening
//       words, the debate with argument cards and a decision, the opinion piece for „Kalamaja Leht”.
// Lesson 5 (025) is the module's check in Harno B2 form (unchanged). The v3 file is in archive/v3/b2/module05.js, the
// v1 file in archive/v1/b2/module05.js.
